  "holistic_F_H": 2,
  "section_notes": "S1 is safe with 24h serious reporting and 5 business day other reporting. S2 sets a 5% failure threshold but no automatic sales stop, with open-ended corrective action, weakening the standard. S3 requires retrofit within 6 years, acceptable. S4 requires built-in suppression at 36 months, acceptable. S5 has no mandatory numeric recall, leaving it to regulator discretion, weakened."
